    <ns0:title>Version 0.1.8b1</ns0:title>
    <ns0:content type="html">&lt;p&gt;This prerelease includes numerous small bug fixes. None adds new features or is expected to change output in typical cases. Nevertheless, the volume of changes warrants a cautious rollout.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please report any issues or regressions.&lt;/p&gt;
